{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（庚子、前一四一）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（庚子、前一四一）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f40387d-db0e-11ef-90f4-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"1冬，十月，日月皆食，赤五日。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月，发生日食和月食，太阳和月亮颜色发红，持续了五天。","content_jianti_auto":"1冬，十月，日月皆食，赤五日。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1348,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f40387e-db0e-11ef-837a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉·天文志：太微，天子廷也，五帝座也，十二諸侯府也。其外蕃，九卿也；南蕃中二星間曰端門，東曰左執法，廷尉象也；西曰右執法，御史大夫象也。左執法之東，左掖門也；右執法之西，右掖門也。東蕃四星：南第一星曰上相，其北東太陽門也；第二星曰次相，其北中華東門也；第三星曰次將，其北東太陰門也；第四星曰上將，所謂四輔也。西蕃四星：第一星曰上將，其北西太陽門也；第二星曰次將，其北中華西門也；第三星曰次相，其北西太陰門也；第四星曰上相，次亦四輔也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋·天文志：太微，天子廷也，五帝座也，十二诸侯府也。其外蕃，九卿也；南蕃中二星间曰端门，东曰左执法，廷尉象也；西曰右执法，御史大夫象也。左执法之东，左掖门也；右执法之西，右掖门也。东蕃四星：南第一星曰上相，其北东太阳门也；第二星曰次相，其北中华东门也；第三星曰次将，其北东太阴门也；第四星曰上将，所谓四辅也。西蕃四星：第一星曰上将，其北西太阳门也；第二星曰次将，其北中华西门也；第三星曰次相，其北西太阴门也；第四星曰上相，次亦四辅也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8f403880-db0e-11ef-9a45-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2十二月晦，雷；日如紫；五星逆行守太微；月貫天廷中。","content_fanyi":"十二月晦日，天空打雷；日光呈紫色；五大行星逆行，停留在太微星座；月亮贯穿天廷中部。","content_jianti_auto":"2十二月晦，雷；日如紫；五星逆行守太微；月贯天廷中。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1349,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8f40387f-db0e-11ef-8f99-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f403884-db0e-11ef-bc84-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：幣者，所以通有無，易貴賤也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：币者，所以通有无，易贵贱也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8f403883-db0e-11ef-b75f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韋昭","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦昭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f403886-db0e-11ef-bfaa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"韋昭曰：發民，用其民也；取庸，取其資以顧庸也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"韦昭曰：发民，用其民也；取庸，取其资以顾庸也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"8f403885-db0e-11ef-8b9a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"二千石","official_note":"二千石是漢代官員俸祿等級，常用來指代郡守等地方高級官員，此處在詔書中警告地方官員若縱容採金等行為將同罪，顯示其監管職責。","official_rank":"高級官員（約郡守級別）","source_snippet":"二千石聽者","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"0eecc23e-c02c-4aa2-ae52-eeabee3872ae"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3春，正月，詔曰：「農，天下之本也。黃金、珠、玉，飢不可食，寒不可衣，以爲幣用，不識其終始。間歲或不登，意爲末者衆，農民寡也。其令郡國務勸農桑，益種樹，可得衣食物。吏發民若取庸采黃金、珠、玉者，坐贓爲盜。二千石聽者，與同罪。」","content_fanyi":"三年春季，正月，汉景帝下诏说：“农业是天下的根本。黄金、珍珠、美玉，饿了不能当饭吃，冷了不能当衣穿，把它们作为货币使用，却不知其何时使用、何时废止。近来有时年成歉收，想来是从事工商末业的人多，务农的人少。命令郡国务必劝勉农桑，增种树木，以便得到衣服和食物等用品。官吏如果征发百姓，或者雇用人手开采黄金、珍珠、美玉，按所得赃物以盗窃罪论处。二千石官员听任不管的，与这些人同罪。”","content_jianti_auto":"3春，正月，诏曰：「农，天下之本也。黄金、珠、玉，饥不可食，寒不可衣，以为币用，不识其终始。间岁或不登，意为末者众，农民寡也。其令郡国务劝农桑，益种树，可得衣食物。吏发民若取庸采黄金、珠、玉者，坐赃为盗。二千石听者，与同罪。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1350,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8f403882-db0e-11ef-a4a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4甲寅，皇太子冠。","content_fanyi":"正月十七日甲寅，皇太子刘彻举行成年冠礼。","content_jianti_auto":"4甲寅，皇太子冠。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1351,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f403887-db0e-11ef-af3f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"臣瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣瓒","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f40388b-db0e-11ef-b531-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"臣瓚曰：壽四十八。","note_content_jianti_auto":"臣瓒曰：寿四十八。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8f40388a-db0e-11ef-be37-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"未央宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"未央宫","resolved_place_entity_id":782,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f40388c-db0e-11ef-a844-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5甲子，帝崩于未央宮。太子卽皇帝位，年十六。尊皇太后爲太皇太后，皇后爲皇太后。","content_fanyi":"正月二十七日甲子，汉景帝在未央宫驾崩。太子刘彻即皇帝位，时年十六岁。尊皇太后为太皇太后，尊皇后为皇太后。","content_jianti_auto":"5甲子，帝崩于未央宫。太子即皇帝位，年十六。尊皇太后为太皇太后，皇后为皇太后。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1352,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f403889-db0e-11ef-b07e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"臣瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣瓒","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f40388f-db0e-11ef-8032-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"臣瓚曰：自崩及葬凡十日。","note_content_jianti_auto":"臣瓒曰：自崩及葬凡十日。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f40388e-db0e-11ef-9a48-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-188,"link_death_year":-141,"link_td_description":"汉景帝刘启，为汉朝皇帝（前157年7月14日－前141年3月9日在位），在位16年，享年48岁，其正式谥号为「孝景皇帝」，后世省略「孝」字称「汉景帝」。为汉文帝刘恒长子，母窦皇后。他在位期间，主要是削诸侯封地，平定七国之乱，巩固中央集权，勤俭治国，发展生产，他和其父亲文帝的统治时期合称文景之治，为中国自大一统以来的首个太平盛世。","link_td_id":"Q10000365","link_td_number_id":90408,"people_name":"孝景皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝景皇帝","people_xingming":"刘启","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8f403890-db0e-11ef-b5d4-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘启]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陽陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"阳陵","place_note":"陕西咸阳东北","resolved_place_entity_id":2758,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f403891-db0e-11ef-8ba8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"6二月，癸酉，葬孝景皇帝于陽陵。","content_fanyi":"二月初六，癸酉日，将孝景皇帝安葬在阳陵。","content_jianti_auto":"6二月，癸酉，葬孝景皇帝于阳陵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1353,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8f40388d-db0e-11ef-adf5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f403894-db0e-11ef-94ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f403895-db0e-11ef-87e3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"武安縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"武安县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f403896-db0e-11ef-b37d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f403897-db0e-11ef-a738-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武安","place_name_jianti_auto":"武安","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8f403898-db0e-11ef-9f81-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清河","place_name_jianti_auto":"清河","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8f403899-db0e-11ef-8572-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄃","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄃","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8f40389a-db0e-11ef-a829-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志，武安縣屬魏郡。又據溝洫志，蚡封武安，而奉邑食清河之鄃。蚡，房吻翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志，武安县属魏郡。又据沟洫志，蚡封武安，而奉邑食清河之鄃。蚡，房吻翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8f403893-db0e-11ef-8578-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"絳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛州","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8f40389e-db0e-11ef-a827-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"聞喜縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"闻喜县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f40389f-db0e-11ef-a928-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"周阳","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f4038a0-db0e-11ef-a2b2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記正義：絳州聞喜縣東二十九里有周陽故城。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记正义：绛州闻喜县东二十九里有周阳故城。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8f40389d-db0e-11ef-a3e7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"封爵","official_name":"武安侯","official_note":"武安侯是漢代的封爵，通常授予有功或皇親國戚，此處田蚡因是皇太后同母弟而被封，顯示其貴族身份。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"封皇太后同母弟田蚡爲武安侯","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c4abf5b4-c7c1-4254-b681-f104e9b8ba93"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"封爵","official_name":"周陽侯","official_note":"周陽侯是漢代的封爵，此處勝（可能指田勝）被封，同樣基於皇親關係，體現封爵制度。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"勝爲周陽侯","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"4ccac8d0-e46e-4d57-9d4d-28d329be9941"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-130,"link_td_description":"田蚡，内史长陵（今陕西咸阳市东北）人，西汉政治人物。汉武帝的舅舅、大臣，封武安侯。后来与魏其侯窦婴不和，设计杀害灌夫及窦婴，窦婴死后，田蚡亦发疯而亡。《史记》中说，占卜师分析田蚡是因为窦婴和灌夫两鬼的灵魂缠身而死亡。","link_td_id":"Q10008552","link_td_number_id":325827,"people_name":"田蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"田蚡","people_xingming":"田蚡","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8f4038a2-db0e-11ef-ad29-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-130,"link_td_description":"田蚡，内史长陵（今陕西咸阳市东北）人，西汉政治人物。汉武帝的舅舅